# Check out every file exactly as committed, on every OS. GitHub's Windows runners set
# core.autocrlf=true, which would add a CR to each line of the data files the crates embed
# (include_str!, e.g. trafilatura's stoplist.txt) and of the test inputs; some WARC and ARC
# fixtures need their CRLFs as they are.
* -text

# GitHub's language statistics (linguist). Recorded inputs and references in the crates' tests
# and the fuzz corpora are data, and parity/data holds third-party files (json_repair's own
# test suite). The scripts that record the data stay counted as source.
parity/data/** linguist-vendored
crates/pyroid-core/tests/**/*.json linguist-vendored
crates/pyroid-core/tests/**/*.jsonl linguist-vendored
crates/pyroid-core/src/**/testdata/**/*.json linguist-vendored
crates/pyroid-core/src/**/testdata/**/*.jsonl linguist-vendored
fuzz/corpus/** linguist-vendored
fuzz/arrow/corpus/** linguist-vendored
bench/results/** linguist-generated
